        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Pinball</strong> launches you into an electrifying arcade experience where interstellar chaos meets nostalgic pinball action. You’re not just flipping a ball—you <i>are</i> the ball: a UFO careening through the stars on a mission to collide with asteroids, rack up points, and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only three lives, you'll need quick reflexes and cosmic focus. While traditional paddles and side walls remain, the rest of the playfield is anything but stable. Space debris, new platforms, and hazards continuously fall from above, reshaping the game every few seconds. No two rounds play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With vibrant visuals, galactic soundscapes, and evolving gameplay, <strong>Space Pinball</strong> is an addictive journey that challenges you to master the cosmos, one bounce at a time.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Pinball</strong> launches you into an electrifying arcade experience where interstellar chaos meets nostalgic pinball action. You’re not just flipping a ball—you <i>are</i> the ball: a UFO careening through the stars on a mission to collide with asteroids, rack up points, and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only three lives, you'll need quick reflexes and cosmic focus. While traditional paddles and side walls remain, the rest of the playfield is anything but stable. Space debris, new platforms, and hazards continuously fall from above, reshaping the game every few seconds. No two rounds play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With vibrant visuals, galactic soundscapes, and evolving gameplay, <strong>Space Pinball</strong> is an addictive journey that challenges you to master the cosmos, one bounce at a time.</p>",
